  "properties": {
    "title": "Introducing OGC Developer Tier membership",
    "description": "OGC wants developers more involved in testing and developing standards - and making sure standards have direct benefits in your work.\n\nOGC is introducing a new developer tier of membership to allow developers to contribute and take advantage of OGC resources and activities more easily. This talk will outline the approach and benefits.",
